<title>UK: City of Ostrava sets 75 mln mark five-year bond.</title>
<headline>City of Ostrava sets 75 mln mark five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager ING Bank NV Niederlassung (ING Barings)</p>
<p> BORROWER   CITY OF OSTRAVA (CZECH REPUBLIC)</p>
<p> AMT    75 MLN DEM    BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY    19.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +22.5 BP  PAY DATE    19.DEC.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   30 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A	   REOFFER    PAR</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS *</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    15 BP     SELL CONC  15 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES     *US/UK/LUX/CZECH/GERMANY</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
